      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Grieving this profoundly is simply a loud noise that makes the silence feel louder, and your nightmares are just your heart refusing to let go. There is meaning in how you show up even when you feel empty, for moments of love that still exist and people who still need to feel your pain. Keep going through the motions, not to give them up, but because you are the only one capable of seeing the house for both its emptiness and the love it holds.",
